# Companion / Live Speech — evidence before code (NO EXCEPTIONS)

User rule (locked Aug 23 2026): **Always** read runtime logs **before** editing code for Companion, PersonaPlex, Live Speech motion, `:8464` iframe, or `:8998` moshi.

Skipping log grep is a regression — same severity as skipping SessionMem or graphify.

## Required before ANY fix (Companion / PersonaPlex / Live Speech)

Run **both** (DGX agent can SSH to Surface for remote-log):

### 1. Surface remote log

| Path | Enable |
|------|--------|
| `OpenNexus3DStudio/logs/remote-log.txt` | `https://<Surface-LAN>:3000/companion/?remoteLog=1` |

Grep recent lines (match user repro timestamp):

```bash
rg -n "companion-iframe|PersonaPlex|applyEmotes|ReferenceError|not defined|Microphone failed|Maximum update|live-speech|handshake|WebSocket" logs/remote-log.txt | tail -60
```

Iframe console appears as **`[companion-iframe]`** when embed relay is active (`?embed=1&remoteLog=1` on iframe).

### 2. DGX stack logs

| Path | What |
|------|------|
| `/tmp/opennexus-companion-stack/personaplex-server.log` | moshi handshake, opus, idle timeout, voice file |
| `/tmp/opennexus-companion-stack/companion.log` | Companion Vite / proxy (Surface may own `:5173`) |

```bash
tail -80 /tmp/opennexus-companion-stack/personaplex-server.log
tail -40 /tmp/opennexus-companion-stack/companion.log
```

## Agent behavior

1. **Agent pulls logs** — DGX agent runs `scp`/`ssh` to Surface `logs/remote-log.txt` and `tail` DGX stack logs **without asking the user to paste**. User paste is fallback only when SSH fails or log file is missing.
2. **Grep first** — cite the log line(s) that prove the bug (e.g. `applyEmotesToTextPrompt is not defined`).
3. **Cross-check** — client ReferenceError in remote-log vs server handshake/idle-timeout in personaplex-server.log.
4. **Fix to match evidence** — do not guess from HUD text alone.
5. **After fix** — agent re-fetches remote-log + DGX logs and reports what changed; tell user to hard-refresh (no new tab).
6. **Sync** — `sync-companion-to-surface.sh` after `chat/app/src/` edits.

